        <div id="general" class="faq-section-group">
            <h2>General</h2>

            <div id="what-is-the-channel" class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is The Channel?</h3>
                <p>The Channel is a personal relationship advisor powered by AI. It helps you understand yourself more deeply, build stronger connections with the people in your life, and navigate relationships with clarity. At its core, it's an AI named Julie who gets to know you over time — your patterns, your strengths, your blind spots — and uses that understanding to give you genuinely personalized advice.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="who-is-julie" class="faq-item">
                <h3>Who is Julie?</h3>
                <p>Julie is the AI at the heart of The Channel. She isn't a generic chatbot — she has a distinct personality: warm, perceptive, gently direct, and deeply caring. Think of her as a wise friend who sees you more clearly than most people do. The more you talk to her, the better she understands you, and the more valuable her insights become.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="how-is-this-different" class="faq-item">
                <h3>How is this different from other apps?</h3>
                <p>Most personality and self-help apps give you static content: take a quiz, get a type, read a description. The Channel is fundamentally different because:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Julie learns about you through natural conversation, not questionnaires</li>
                    <li>Your insights evolve and deepen over time as Julie understands more</li>
                    <li>It's not just about you — it helps you understand your relationships with specific people</li>
                    <li>Every piece of advice is personalized to your actual situation, not generic tips</li>
                    <li>Julie remembers everything — your history, your people, your patterns</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div id="delete-account" class="faq-item">
                <h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
                <p>Go to the settings page in the app and select the option to delete your account. All your data — conversations, insights, and personal information — will be permanently removed. If you have questions or feedback before you go, we'd love to hear from you at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="how-it-works" class="faq-section-group">
            <h2>How It Works</h2>

            <div id="what-do-i-need" class="faq-item">
                <h3>What do I need to get started?</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your name</li>
                    <li>Your birth date</li>
                    <li>Where you were born</li>
                    <li>Where you live now</li>
                </ul>
                <p>That's it. Julie takes it from there — she'll start with some initial reads on your personality, and the conversation builds naturally from there.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="what-are-insights" class="faq-item">
                <h3>What are insights?</h3>
                <p>Insights are AI-generated observations about you and your relationships. They're created automatically from your conversations — you don't write them yourself. A 15-minute conversation might produce one or two insights, or none if nothing meaningful came up. They appear on your personal page and on each person's page, building a living picture of who you are and how you relate to the people in your life.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="how-does-memory-work" class="faq-item">
                <h3>How does Julie's memory work?</h3>
                <p>Julie remembers everything you've told her — past conversations, the people in your life, patterns she's noticed. When you chat, she pulls in the right context so every response feels informed by your full history with her. You see a clean, simple chat. Behind the scenes, Julie has the full picture.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="adding-people" class="faq-item">
                <h3>How do I add people to my circle?</h3>
                <p>You can add someone by entering their name, your relationship type, and their birth info (date is enough — birth time is optional). Julie will generate initial insights about their personality and your dynamic. You can also mention people in conversation and Julie will suggest adding them.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="using-the-app" class="faq-section-group">
            <h2>Using the App</h2>

            <div id="question-types" class="faq-item">
                <h3>What can I talk to Julie about?</h3>
                <p>Anything that's on your mind about yourself or your relationships:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Understanding why a relationship feels stuck or distant</li>
                    <li>Preparing for a difficult conversation</li>
                    <li>Processing a fight or misunderstanding</li>
                    <li>Understanding your own patterns and blind spots</li>
                    <li>Figuring out what someone in your life needs from you</li>
                    <li>General self-reflection about who you are and where you're going</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Julie's best when you talk naturally — the more real you are, the more useful her responses become.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="future-predictions" class="faq-item">
                <h3>Will the app predict my future?</h3>
                <p>No. The Channel helps you understand yourself and your relationships more clearly so you can make better decisions. Julie might surface patterns she's noticed ("you tend to pull away when things get intense") but she's not a fortune teller — she's a relationship advisor who respects your agency and free will.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="check-frequency" class="faq-item">
                <h3>How often should I use it?</h3>
                <p>Use it whenever something's on your mind — a relationship question, a pattern you noticed, a conversation you're preparing for. Some people check in daily, others come when they need to think something through. The more you chat, the richer your insights become, but there's no right frequency. Julie is there when you need her.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="privacy-security" class="faq-section-group">
            <h2>Privacy & Security</h2>

            <div id="data-safety" class="faq-item">
                <h3>Is my personal information safe?</h3>
                <p>Yes. We take privacy seriously — especially because The Channel works best when you share personal details. Your data is encrypted, stored securely on Azure servers, and never sold to third parties. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for full details.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="who-sees-insights" class="faq-item">
                <h3>Can other people see my insights?</h3>
                <p>No. Everything in The Channel is completely private. Your conversations, insights, and relationship pages are visible only to you. Nobody else — not even the people in your circle — can see what's on your pages.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
